title: "Multi-Agent NL2SQL with CrewAI"
abstract: >
  A reproducible multi-agent natural-language-to-SQL implementation using
  CrewAI, evaluated on the Spider 1.0 development set with a 4-stage baseline,
  two 5-stage ablations, and a 6-stage proposed pipeline.
